  "notes": "{返答|へんとう} is composed of {返|へん} (return) + {答|とう} (answer).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {返答|へんとう}する: to reply\n- {返答|へんとう}に{困|こま}る: to be stuck for a reply\n- {返答|へんとう}を{待|ま}つ: to wait for a reply\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {返答|へんとう}: reply (somewhat formal, to questions or requests)\n- {返事|へんじ}: reply (everyday, general response)\n- {回答|かいとう}: answer (formal, to surveys, official questions)",
